export function escapeHtml(t){return String(t).replace(/&/g,"&amp;").replace(/</g,"&lt;").replace(/>/g,"&gt;").replace(/"/g,"&quot;").replace(/'/g,"&#039;")}export function calculateAgeYears(t){const e=new Date(t),r=new Date;let n=r.getFullYear()-e.getFullYear();const o=r.getMonth()-e.getMonth(),i=r.getDate()-e.getDate();return(o<0||0===o&&i<0)&&(n-=1),n}export function extractPublicPath(t){return String(t??"").replace(/^https?:\/\//i,"")}export function formatYearMonth(t){return`${t.getFullYear()}-${String(t.getMonth()+1).padStart(2,"0")}`}export function clampNumber(t,e,r){return Math.min(r,Math.max(e,t))}export function isLikelyEmailAddress(t){return/^[^\s@]+@[^\s@]+\.[^\s@]+$/.test(String(t??"").trim())}export function isLikelyPhoneNumber(t){const e=String(t??"").trim();return/^\+?[0-9]{7,15}$/.test(e)}export function toSafeMailtoUrl(t){const e=String(t??"").trim();return isLikelyEmailAddress(e)?`mailto:${e}`:""}export function toSafeTelUrl(t){const e=String(t??"").replace(/[^0-9+]/g,"");return isLikelyPhoneNumber(e)?`tel:${e}`:""}export function toSafeExternalUrl(t){if("string"!=typeof t||!t.trim())return"";try{const e=new URL(t);return"https:"===e.protocol?e.href:""}catch{return""}}export function truncateAtWordBoundary(t,e){const r=String(t??"").trim();if(!e||r.length<=e)return r;const n=r.slice(0,e),o=n.lastIndexOf(" ");return`${(o>40?n.slice(0,o):n).trim()}...`}export function countWords(t){const e=String(t??"").match(/[A-Za-z0-9+#/.-]+/g);return e?e.length:0}